{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "77b8e4abe252733683f1b10b4e350b7ab8cc3117aed3e01b774df2504c991f2a", "ja": "こけら落とし公演に向けた\n劇場での合宿準備中……", "zh": "正在为剧场首演进行集训准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "6e96fe4489b03109f4a69fb4e1ca82bc9a18fc809f0552724b42c604c7d6e874", "ja": "いよいよ合宿～♪　準備はしゅくしゅく～♪\nパジャマにトランプ、あとおやつ～♪", "zh": "集训终于要开始啦～♪　准备工作有条不紊～♪\n睡衣还有扑克牌，再带上小点心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "40f92b4c4ec9232ffcb97c13c8b08d79f4a3eb8f769ed15bdee641837a050d7c", "ja": "おやつなら私も準備してるよ！\nもちろん、みんなの分も！", "zh": "零食的话，我也准备好了哦！\n当然，也有大家的份！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d09ba3dcfc5687ba4c60cf3d59ea45d28a54d0fda1f9062e291c4bff8b9ad51", "ja": "さんぼ、わさんぼ、和三盆～♪\nみんなもどうぞ、和三盆～♪", "zh": "三盆、和三盆、和三盆～♪\n大家也请用，和三盆～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "212801698f3a94e6d06c2a48eceaa6f030b66819d07bb84b35d3c790581e574b", "ja": "わさんぼーん♪　和三盆のお菓子って、私食べたこと\nないかもしれません！　楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "和三盆——♪　用和三盆做的点心，我可能\n还没吃过呢！好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "3ab0693d3b380f0bc67fd87f9de4bea91227eefc9c5148858499daa621b6700b", "ja": "やれやれ。トランプとかおやつもいいけど、\n大事なこと忘れるなよ。", "zh": "真拿你们没办法。玩扑克和吃点心是不错，\n但可别忘了正事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "57b00aaaf21a5eb71c2423474799dd44f12faaea1ea914b7d887b74b769164ea", "ja": "劇場での合宿は、あくまで特訓のため。\nお泊り会とかじゃないからな？", "zh": "剧场合宿说到底是为了特训。\n可不是来开住宿聚会的，懂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "090faeb3605c8524c8ebd15dfebb2d7df8a1d15b52a55e9bc94ec1c1bf441676", "ja": "あはは、テンション高くていいじゃん♪\nまあアタシも高まってるんだけど！", "zh": "啊哈哈，情绪高涨点不是挺好嘛♪\n不过我自己也正兴奋着呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "da1d58dcc251a6b9bfebc5209bde113a28cab1f61e68fea26476c4882f80f3ee", "ja": "だって、いよいよ劇場がオープンするんだもん！\n高ぶるなって方が無理だよね～！", "zh": "因为剧场终于要开张了嘛！\n要我不激动才不可能吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "f41da55fc483130d88436fe80743e9bb5a34b1352adf811b8a55d0e245ddb2a1", "ja": "はい！　おやつは持って行きますけど、カロリー全部\n消費するくらい、みんなとレッスンします！", "zh": "好的！点心我会带着，不过会和大家一起练习到把卡路里全部消耗掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "00763f2af09b6b2881446fc2493da628100dcf963b03e4e387bf3dc2a99de5c6", "ja": "ちなみに、今日は合宿の準備かなーって思ったんだけど\n……ミーティングは私たち、Team7thだけ？", "zh": "顺便说一下，我还以为今天是准备合宿什么的……不过，只有我们Team7th来开会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2d13a987ba572e574b3cc233866d21b2fe56b654cd4ae89e142bdd3918ef58b", "ja": "そうなんだよな。てっきり他のチームも\n呼ばれてると思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "就是啊。我还以为其他队伍也都被叫来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "b05075deca2e41363f21b4c038ba7ae9730a7ac20dfc9bf22b18cf35ab3f304f", "ja": "あれ？　そういえば～……？", "zh": "哎？　这么说来～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "33fc9f3cdb73a9b6467b485f1e727ed1cd2452ec5b29faae6314f72db6ece796", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\nTeam7th、集まってるな？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。  \nTeam第7队，大家都到齐了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f410a1f3c586ceb2b75bce01aa42c43b5577808c0543c7d03a0ad8d294ab455e", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー、お疲れさま！\nねえ、今日って合宿の話じゃないの？", "zh": "啊，制作人，辛苦啦！\n那个，今天不是要聊集训的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "d8704d0f5cc578652652b937c3caa91d5eb22e4d7e73fd34e9e5f41a918e0b85", "ja": "ああ、合宿の話をする前に……\nみんなに相談させてほしいことがあるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，在聊合宿的事之前……\n我有件事想和大家商量一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "0e76eeb5b6e54b02a39fb33322a00a80786319fcffc59c767d54110e328d2e2d", "ja": "相談？", "zh": "商量？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "b18ca17e5c7c70c7af98390a433b99c144b8a3263f5729af547ec31a91a5c777", "ja": "実は、新人アイドルの登竜門と言っていい\nライブイベントが近々開催されるんだけど……。", "zh": "其实，可以说是新人偶像龙门的一场\n演出活动近期就要举办了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "eadbb0346881dfd31dd8e5e2a7e9d57b78b07f90372acaef43871c38c3166450", "ja": "Team7thにオファーがきた。\nしかも、大トリだ。", "zh": "给Team7th发来了演出邀请。\n而且，还是压轴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "ba9c0d0ee8b8c8a534eb3f9d1c8193906b69e8291554cbc62b88459373208e4a", "ja": "マジか！？", "zh": "真的假的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "06f9384218a72bbb87068be1be09f9e130de13f8e17ff308f22a37a5198adc20", "ja": "わあ♪", "zh": "哇♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "dd4d923fac9260128a9581a89399f7740e69d9cda918e88a5abe6eab5cae642b", "ja": "オオトリ！？", "zh": "压轴！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ef059b31fdff8ef5e875a659c7e91c1a8073241821eed639a8b766bb000e19bd", "ja": "マイガー！", "zh": "我的天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "a95689a2af2925d04bcb5f66df7c519d2cd175b15923fe67ec43abee94c60ca1", "ja": "今までのチームが作ってくれた盛り上がりと、\nフェスでのデビューステージが評価されたんだろう。", "zh": "大概是因为之前各队伍营造出的热烈气氛，以及在庆典上的出道舞台得到了认可吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "2d0ff568d8394e4564ef4500c12b82a941121147195c07467a27c6fe70b4d3b6", "ja": "ただ、開催日が本当に目の前で……\n今回の合宿期間中なんだ。", "zh": "不过，举办日真的近在眼前……就在这次集训期间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1028_401pro", "source_sha256": "59a2076327aaedae42141b9751907de1d4cbe29493bd6e3ddedae13150ca0cfa", "ja": "みんなの本番は、こけら落とし公演だと思ってる。\nでも、これを見逃すのは……あまりにも惜しい。", "zh": "我觉得大家的正式演出应该是开幕公演。\n但是，要错过这次……实在太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "76120d71cd2a8b305e2c42732558ea7e1022db17751f198842f73619ae2697ef", "ja": "ただ、やるとなったら、当然負担が大きくなる。\nだから、みんなの意見も聞いておきたくて……。", "zh": "不过，既然决定要做，负担当然会很大。所以，我想先听听大家的意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e8526b098606e0aee0a04bd9cf46843dab826331f40bd2b37b86a65de32d645", "ja": "まあ、レッスン並行だもんね。\nそりゃ大変になるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "毕竟要同时兼顾课程嘛。\n我也觉得肯定会很辛苦就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "494d5eefe3ecae42a12dc982b89be7c6d74607e9c540ca4b51e0522b4c4b94c7", "ja": "でもさ、これってすっごいチャンスなんじゃない？\nアタシはそう思ったけどな。", "zh": "不过啊，这不是个超棒的机会吗？\n我是这么觉得的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1032_036kan", "source_sha256": "2b457a92f5f31793fe74fb189f7a3e37404b73d163ffd531ca84ed178b870701", "ja": "そんな有名なライブイベントで歌えたら、\n私達も立派なアイドルってことになりますよね！", "zh": "要是能在那么有名的现场活动上唱歌，我们也就算是真正的偶像了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e3df3cee5c1921e11b6aaa0cd0ac8644e593b1105ce632a94ce4c1cf0f35a2b", "ja": "アイドルはどうしてステージで歌うんですか？\nそこにステージがあるからです！　なんてなんて♪", "zh": "偶像为什么要在舞台上唱歌呢？\n因为那里有舞台啊！开玩笑的啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "664967ccded9c8194a4605c8afcb8487999977b4e7cf40498533bb5afc734c68", "ja": "山みたいに言うな。ったく……。\nま、その通りなんだけどさ。", "zh": "别说得跟爬山一样啊。真是的……\n嘛，虽然确实是那么回事就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b6d2023fb2a6679b496f1f067bb8bb9931a9e1ae837458846d9c3c51d095c1c3", "ja": "あ！　こけら落とし直前にライブするってことは、\n最高の宣伝にもなるんじゃない！？", "zh": "啊！在首演前夕办演出的这事，\n不也是一次绝佳的宣传机会吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "798d1afb3f97a34cbefd05796ad62df165f49add7f80d9ac360e293478616c09", "ja": "わあ、ホントだ！　歩さんすごい、頭いい！\n天才かも～！", "zh": "哇，真的耶！步小姐好厉害，真聪明！  \n说不定是天才哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebd3d5f99969e18c9dfd60ea68f00e40ba55b47081ef0f7450b6c5e0037cb303", "ja": "ライブが盛り上がったら、みんな劇場にも\n来てくれそうだよね！　よっ、すごあゆあゆ～♪", "zh": "要是演唱会的气氛炒热了，大家也会来剧场吧！哟，厉害了步步～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bf308ae9da22d17c6b9d30af3130215e615945ed24d899883c22dbaced4326a4", "ja": "えへへ、それほどでも……、\nあったりする！？", "zh": "嘿嘿，也没那么夸张……才怪！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1039_050jul", "source_sha256": "0ac60798b393ba8c02546854fe8f66a768a3dff6c46d304878b5bc4af3b4df86", "ja": "ようするにだ。プロデューサー、ここにはステージに\n出たいヤツしかいないらしい。", "zh": "总而言之，制作人，看来这里\n全是些想登上舞台的家伙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1040_401pro", "source_sha256": "ae7804e14b5046f12144ec03b0e0f09d5fd11da4b4a481c5c18e1402cee5e2e9", "ja": "みんな……。", "zh": "大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "d9243e113e43ab63f4a52519641f9346162a05960b22a8c5b896736ae8603030", "ja": "それに、どうやら日和ってる時間もなさそうだし。\n決まりでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "而且，看起来也没时间再犹豫了。就这么定了，应该没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "1c0d301e0a4cb3615521de093860c237043bd5a617e5ce4a0a8235de6b88d0a7", "ja": "そうだな……うん、俺も覚悟を決めるよ。\nプロデューサーとして、改めてみんなにお願いしたい。", "zh": "是啊……嗯，我也做好觉悟了。\n\n作为制作人，我想再次拜托大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1043_401pro", "source_sha256": "67ce89750b3fb17aa3c5f7180cc67bbe76079ee989f8ef576ad3d84b89df4a7e", "ja": "このライブイベントがMILLIONSTARSにとって、\nこけら落とし公演前の、最後の仕事になると思う。", "zh": "我想，这次现场活动会是MILLIONSTARS在剧场开幕公演前的最后一项工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1044_401pro", "source_sha256": "ae30c8728c35a17b4c8e15676fc7f91dfc0c42cd349d2fd13291f2465f88a1e4", "ja": "全力のステージを披露して、\n劇場のオープンにつなげてほしい！", "zh": "希望你们拿出全力以赴的舞台，为剧场的开幕助一臂之力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "debc34566c5e6e2e517cf5af11358a37fc13058687a7db5ae373f0764dd473f0", "ja": "了解！　他のチームのみんなが、ここまでつないで\nくれたんだもん。アタシ達だって決めてみせるよ！", "zh": "明白！其他队伍的大家都努力帮我们走到这一步了。我们也一定会做到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "717f6ff4c4b31efdee0c12de121150ec65a0a573ddd996c6d7e6b8b18a093405", "ja": "私も、一生懸命歌って踊ります！\n可奈はアイドル～、ライブ頑張る～♪", "zh": "我也会努力唱歌跳舞的！可奈是偶像～会努力唱好现场的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1047_048rei", "source_sha256": "fb6c2880c7d8095424bfcbd85d3abd557a30bacc5e3eb4f3d34e3f94ef816e08", "ja": "イベントのお客さんも、他の出演者さんも！\nみんなみんな、劇場に連れてきちゃいますね！", "zh": "活动的客人也好，其他出演者也好！\n我要把大家全都带到剧场来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1048_050jul", "source_sha256": "36759298b916ecaf4a2e4401a5c86b817ecdd419a927d1ad5ea8194f5e40e916", "ja": "ああ、ウチらが最高の形でつないでやるよ！\nMILLIONSTARS Team7th！　行くぜ！", "zh": "啊，我们会以最棒的形式将这一切连接起来！\nMILLIONSTARS Team7th！上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0327_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0327_story_intro_1049_050jul", "source_sha256": "78bbce99f4ff5868917916be50a034382eb9a815c6fbf5b5a608d99cc24b122f", "ja": "おー！！", "zh": "哦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
